competing for shared capacity with 31 other components.

The fix: compute the Planck function explicitly and feed it in as an
engineered input, rather than making the network infer it.

    function B = planckRadiance(T, wavenumberCm1)
        c1 = 1.191042e-5; c2 = 1.4387752; nu = wavenumberCm1;
        B = (c1*nu.^3) ./ (exp(c2*nu./T) - 1);
    end
    
